<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Automatic Scooter Daily Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>An automatic scooter rents in Hanoi at one of two verified daily prices: 150,000 VND per day for the entry tier and 200,000 VND per day for the step-up tier. This guide plans the daily rental around both numbers, because the honest question for an automatic rider is not just what a day costs, but which tier the day actually needs.</p>
<p>We cover the two verified daily rates, which machines sit in each tier, what each tier buys, day-by-day budget planning, the break-even math against the published weekly rates, and the deposit, gear and fuel questions that turn a headline rate into a real budget. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The two verified daily rates</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">The entry-tier automatics</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">The step-up tier automatics</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">Planning a daily budget</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">The break-even math</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Automatics versus semi-automatics</a></li>
